Axiomatic Design Skills

The axiomatic-software-design skill adapts the design method described in:
Sun-Jae Kim, Nam P. Suh, and Sang-Gook Kim, "Design of Software Systems Based on Axiomatic Design," Robotics & Computer-Integrated Manufacturing, volume 8, number 4, 1991, pages 243–255.

See skills/axiomatic-software-design/references/source-notes.md for details.
